{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15552","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 崔绩","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝京春气早，御柳已先荣。\n嫩叶随风散，浮光向月明。\n悠扬生别意，断续引芳声。\n积翠连驰道，飘花出禁城。\n柔条依水弱，远色带烟轻。\n南望龙池畔，斜光照晚晴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}